A Site with one file.

```console
$ shelf check notes.txt
✓ 1 file, 12 bytes ([..] packed). Ready to upload.

```

A relative link in a one-file Site goes outside the Site.

```console
$ shelf check page.html
! page.html:1: other.html goes outside this Site. A Site with one file has no other files.
✓ 1 file, 31 bytes ([..] packed). Ready to upload.

```

A dotfile is not uploaded, also when it is named.

```console
$ shelf check .hidden
? failed
✗ .hidden is a dotfile. Dotfiles are not uploaded.
error: Fix the errors before the upload.

```

A path that does not exist. The cause text comes from the OS.

```console
$ shelf check missing.txt
? failed
error: Cannot open missing.txt
...

```
